{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X不如Y细致地贴合音乐小节，局部音色、旋律起伏和情绪转折的同步提示较少，感受层次也有所压缩。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的关键词加亮和感受分时出现，扫视时容易抓住局部重点，也能更细地跟随音乐变化，但感受词过多、部分重复，容易让注意力在不同意象之间跳转。X虽然需要读的句子较长，却把人物每一步的顾虑、念头变化及其前因后果交代得更充分，尤其能让人理解他为什么从小心隐藏走向坦然表达，并把十四段看成一条连续的心理历程。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b73d18ad-f942-456b-8133-8fcad6ad2de2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T075637855787Z", "elapsed_seconds": 79.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T07:57:56.865738+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c48697c5243045720b3016d57398f90af82bd97078af5ff40f5cc63399dcbb4c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700